      "changes": {
        "long_description": {
          "before": "Physical Turing rolls out humanoids in the real world and captures failures for benchmarking and post-training.\r\n\r\nWe procure, staff, and operate a wide range of target environments for real-world rollouts, helping robot makers, model companies, and enterprises continuously evaluate where humanoids succeed, where they fail, and what needs to improve before each deployment.",
          "after": "Physical Turing is a neo robot deployer. Our hardware-agnostic operating system lets us deploy any robot fast, and every deployment produces the real-world data we use to train our own intelligence.\r\n\r\nWe're starting by automating industrial inspection and security tasks, which have historically had labor shortages due to their safety risks."
        },
